    "title": "#2 ADM holds off #3 Storm Lake in 72-70 double-overtime battle, Tornadoes end year at 24-3 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Anthony Mitchell ,\n1 hours ago\nDES MOINES, Iowa (KCAU) – #2 ADM advances to the IHSAA 3A State semifinals with a 72-70 win over #3 Storm Lake in double overtime.\nJaidyn Coon led Storm Lake with 36 points and 18 rebounds while Cam Boyd chipped in 18 points for the Tornadoes.\nHudson Lorensen poured in 38 points for ADM in the win.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KCAU 9 News | Sioux City, IA | News, Weather, and Sports.",
